			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Parvaneh"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 220220101,
					"content": "This recipe should be like this...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220102,
					"content": "What are you doing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220103,
					"content": "I'm sorting recipes out. Unfortunately, I can't remember some of them clearly...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220104,
						220220106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220104,
					"content": "Why not ask Xudong?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220105,
					"content": "Xudong... He and his \"creative dishes\" are the main reasons why I can't remember them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220109,
					"content": "Every time he gets hold of a new recipe, he'll only follow the recipe for a day or two at most.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220110,
					"content": "Then, he... tries various things to improve them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220111,
						220220113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220111,
					"content": "Why would he do that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220112,
					"content": "According to him, it's to make them less expensive... But I'm not quite sure why he did all that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220118,
					"content": "But anyway, the results speak for themselves. He was indeed successful.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220119,
					"content": "The taste is similar to the original, but the production cost is ridiculously low.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220120,
					"content": "His outrageous cooking methods are the reason why I was willing to work with him. And I think the reason he was willing to take me on is because of my skills.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220121,
						220220123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220121,
					"content": "So, what do you want me to do for you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220122,
					"content": "Ah... whoops! I was so busy talking about Xudong that I almost forgot the topic at hand...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220128,
					"content": "Xudong has been pestering me to change the recipes. He would write and draw directly on them... As such, some recipes have become hard to read.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220129,
					"content": "I want to recover those recipes accurately and save a copy in case a proper one is needed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220130,
					"content": "Traveler, if you still remember them, could you help me out?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220131,
						220220132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220131,
					"content": "No problem.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220133,
					"content": "Thanks. So I'll sort out the messed-up recipes, and you can correct the unclear parts...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220132,
					"content": "Of course. I've been eating my way across Teyvat.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220123,
					"content": "Your skills?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220124,
					"content": "Haven't I told you? My research topic at Akademiya is the \"ultimate seasoning.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220125,
					"content": "Simply put, I mean to create a super seasoning that can make any food delicious.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220126,
					"content": "That's the reason I'm out here to collect information on various cuisines.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220127,
					"content": "Ahem, I've gone on too long. Let's get back to the recipes...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220113,
					"content": "How exactly would he improve them?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220114,
					"content": "Well... his way is different from others. Most chefs try to make the recipe richer so that the dish can be sold at a higher price.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220115,
					"content": "But Xudong seems to have a completely different principle...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220116,
					"content": "For example, he used potatoes, mushrooms, and some other cheap vegetables to make a vegetarian dish which somehow tasted like Jueyun Chili Chicken...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220117,
					"content": "There is also this simplified version of Adeptus' Temptation made with Potatoes, Rice, Lotus Head, Jueyun Chili, dough, and Raw Meat. The texture and taste are somehow similar to the original dish...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220106,
					"content": "Wait. Aren't you The Gourmet Supremos?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220220107,
					"content": "Please don't mention that name to me again. These words will never appear in my paper...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				},
				{
					"id": 220220108,
					"content": "Besides, Xudong and his \"creative dishes\" are the main reasons why I can't remember these recipes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220220109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Parvaneh"
				}
			]
		},
		{
